{"overview":"فوجینوی محبوب و خوش‌برخورد، به‌خاطر کمیک‌های خنده‌داری که در روزنامه‌ی دیواری کلاس می‌کشد، مورد تحسین هم‌کلاسی‌هایش است. روزی معلمش از او می‌خواهد که این فضا را با کیوموتوی  گوشه‌گیر و فراری از مدرسه که آثار هنری زیبایش شور و شوق رقابتی را در فوجینو برمی‌انگیزاند، تقسیم کند. چیزی که به‌عنوان حسادت آغاز می‌شود، زمانی که فوجینو متوجه اشتیاق مشترکشان به نقاشی می‌شود، دگرگون می‌گردد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Popular, outgoing Fujino is celebrated by her classmates for her funny comics in the class newspaper. One day, her teacher asks her to share the space with Kyomoto, a truant recluse whose beautiful artwork sparks a competitive fervor in Fujino. What starts as jealousy transforms when Fujino realizes their shared passion for drawing.","tagline_en":"Manga drew them together. Life made them best friends.","runtime":58,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["押山清高"],"crew_en":["Kiyotaka Oshiyama"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"یومی کاوای","role":"Fujino (voice)","photo":"/pcYp2J96Kt0M2MuLE6BRb6b6nGG.jpg","en":"Yuumi Kawai"},{"name":"吉田美月喜","role":"Kyomoto (voice)","photo":"/7bMv0ajEYjp70AKHxH63Xfng2ga.jpg","en":"Mizuki Yoshida"},{"name":"斉藤陽一郎","role":"Homeroom Teacher (voice)","photo":"/1pU5WwEE3DtV4M9nhtUt4p3wrwa.jpg","en":"Yoichiro Saito"},{"name":"岡幸太","role":"Man (voice)","photo":"/a97rszQiJzCi4hD3kJa23ZfXalM.jpg","en":"Kota Oka"},{"name":"牧紅葉","role":"Fujino's Sister (voice)","photo":"/lsFHrk5De0KsZ9VP30vQu013NqH.jpg","en":"Kureha Maki"},{"name":"吉橋航也","role":"Editor (voice)","photo":"/jKD5vwVwYWteRo9bpzkhvvG6W4H.jpg","en":"Koya Yoshihashi"},{"name":"宮島岳史","role":"Newscaster (voice)","photo":"/webfozdOnWN4xuyQcZYptiH9Xex.jpg","en":"Takeshi Miyajima"},{"name":"高橋大輔","role":"Announcer (voice)","photo":"/sDuT3eITAUxkJ5tTjxGxokC19pH.jpg","en":"Daisuke Takahashi"},{"name":"伊東潤","role":"Teacher (voice)","photo":"/2vtTHj0xY20QwwGkYusZ8I38elO.jpg","en":"Jun Ito"},{"name":"竹内芳織","role":"Friend's Mother (voice)","photo":"/cW6wIQixLWB3